Hi,

For those that use Motif, it is now available on IA64. We've built it on 
the 8/28/00 release of TurboLinux and it passes the automated test suite 
perfectly.

The software can be downloaded from the Motif community website that ICS 
sponsors, MotifZone. The download page is: 
http://www.motifzone.net/download/dldform.php

The full press release is available at: 
